                        "form": "mentees"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6f8e7083-ef8c-3873-a5b1-586f05aaa9a0",
                        "entry_id": "68f3a357-6aac-3a5c-9908-fb0ae07d0655",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who is being mentored."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e96cde8-42f7-494c-827e-73ab9551d277",
                                "sense_id": "6f8e7083-ef8c-3873-a5b1-586f05aaa9a0",
                                "text": "Near-synonyms: apprentice, buddy (in training sense), intern, pupil, student, trainee"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dce0e8b9-abf8-4fd4-8cde-c794bbb20fb4",
                                "sense_id": "6f8e7083-ef8c-3873-a5b1-586f05aaa9a0",
                                "text": "The mentee occasionally teaches the class, regularly confers with students, conducts optional special study sessions, and relieves the professor of most clerical classroom functions"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6e7b0e0-2dab-4f64-92be-35501a2c9edd",
                                "sense_id": "6f8e7083-ef8c-3873-a5b1-586f05aaa9a0",
                                "text": "[T]he two characters form a beautiful mentor-mentee relationship in which each derives tremendous strength from the other"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1c3088b-309a-4123-8f99-c12630acf0be",
                                "sense_id": "6f8e7083-ef8c-3873-a5b1-586f05aaa9a0",
                                "text": "In some mentorship programs, the mentees get a say in whom they will be paired with. A 'mentee may be drawn to make certain connections based on a sense of their professional influence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "afde862f-038a-4054-9853-596ea9c25e30",
                                "sense_id": "6f8e7083-ef8c-3873-a5b1-586f05aaa9a0",
                                "text": "Her assistant, played by Noémie Merlant (another would-be conductor) appears to be someone else she is keeping on an emotional string, and she is being stalked by another former mentee who has become obsessed with her;[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
